<title>USA: Burlington says top forwarder in India.</title>
<headline>Burlington says top forwarder in India.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, California 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Air Express (BAX) said it was the leading freight forwarder by revenue last year among freight forwarders in India.</p>
<p>The company, citing 1996 figures compiled by the International Air Transport Association(IATA), said BAX India recorded a 30 percent increase in revenues to $19.7 million in its fifth year of operations in that country.</p>
<p>The year before, BAX India was ranked sixth by revenue. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
